# The team's running state: tools/team/pacer.sh keeps its files in pacer/,
# tools/team/spending_account.py its tables in spending/, and
# tools/team/specialist.sh each specialist's port and home note in ports.
# Tracked: 'ports' and 'pacer/anchor'. The rest is the pacer's runtime state:
pacer/pid
pacer/PAUSE
pacer/STOP
pacer/ALLOW
pacer/holds/
pacer/mail_seen
pacer/running-session
pacer/.run.lock
pacer/session.*.out
pacer/run.out
pacer/nohup.out
pacer/restart.out
pacer/jeff-files/
pacer/jeff-check.log
# A table or the ports file being rewritten, left only by a crash:
*.tmp

# Untracked for now: they hold session summaries that may name Jeff's notes, and Jeff decides whether those go in the code repo.
pacer/pacer.log
spending/account.tsv
spending/requests.tsv
